      "credit": "Keep Going",
      "source": "Keep Going (3663280343)",
      "description": "I don't know if any of us has enough gumption to be reincarnated as wild salmon. These fish are nearing the end of their amazing and perilous journey up the Yukon River when seen here in the holding pen at the top of the fishladder at the Whitehorse power dam. Every stroke and gasp is dedicated to reaching a grand finale far up a mountain stream. Only the fittest (and luckiest) of the species will spawn in the gravel bed where each began its great circle of life.",
